        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And cyricgrið dyre æghwar be mæðe ofer ealle ðam rice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[4] And Church sanctuary is to be respected everywhere according to its degree over the entire kingdom.</ab>
